    "arithmetic": "All four ablated adapters scored 37-52/64 versus 61/64 for the intact adapter (base 38/64, prompt 42/64). Paired ablated-minus-full intervals were below zero for all four interventions: q -14.1 points [-25.0,-4.7], v -37.5 [-46.9,-28.1], and either layer half -23.4 [-29.7,-15.6]. This 64-question development result is not capability-preservation confirmation.",
